  <!--翻译内容: 'Under the effect of an immunosuppressant, hampering the body's ability to fight off infection and disease.',新增于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Under the effect of an immunosuppressant, hampering the body's ability to fight off infection and disease.-->
  <Hediff_Cyclosporine.description>在免疫抑制剂的作用下，身体抵抗感染和疾病的能力受到抑制。</Hediff_Cyclosporine.description>
  <!--翻译内容: 'Cyclosporine',新增于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Cyclosporine-->
