  <!--翻译内容: 'A condition caused by a womb entering the most fertile phase of its menstrual cycle. Sexual arousal and desire increase dramatically as the body yearns to become pregnant.
Increased chance of vaginal sex occurring and potentially lower standards in mate selection.',新增于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: A condition caused by a womb entering the most fertile phase of its menstrual cycle. Sexual arousal and desire increase dramatically as the body yearns to become pregnant.
Increased chance of vaginal sex occurring and potentially lower standards in mate selection.-->
  <Hediff_Estrus.description>因子宫进入月经周期中最易受孕的阶段而导致的状态。随着身体渴望怀孕，性唤起和性欲急剧增加。
阴道性交发生的几率增加，择偶标准可能降低。</Hediff_Estrus.description>
